  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "リハーサル終了後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-2:caption",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うーん……さっきのアイドル、\n様子がちぃとおかしかったのぉー。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "2人が話してた人たち？　うん、リハでも\nあんまり元気がなかったね。大丈夫かな……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…あのアイドルだけじゃない。\n全体的に重苦しい雰囲気だった。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…先程プロデューサーに聞いた、\n番組の存続問題が影響しているんだろう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…単純な話だが、\n人の気持ちというのは伝染していくものだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…特に『悲しい、辛い』という負の感情は、\n『幸せ』よりも繰り返し思い返してしまう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…だから、人の心にも残りやすいという。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それじゃあ……僕たちが楽しい気持ちでいれば、\nそれも現場に伝染していくかな？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あとは本番だけだから、時間もないし、\n出来る事は少ないかもしれないけど……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いーや、涼。本番だけで十分じゃ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ワシらはもともと、歌って踊ってワイワイ喋って、\nカメラの向こうのみんなを笑顔にする予定じゃった。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それが、カメラのこっち側のみんなも\nまとめて笑顔にするって話に変わっただけじゃ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ちぃと数が増えただけで、何も心配いらん！\nじゃけぇ、笑顔でステージに向かおう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大吾くん……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_f.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 26,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ、説得力すごすぎだよ。\n今の大吾くんの笑顔で、僕も自信が出てきたもの！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_f:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
